00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:20.120
And because it
appears to be just

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:22.160
all these general
interactions are slow,

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:23.780
things like application
level metrics,

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:25.790
like latency metrics for
